    "body": "### Problem:\r\nWith multicursors, an Insert-mode mapping that edits buffer via API (`nvim_put()`, `nvim_buf_set_text()`, `vim.snippet.expand()`, …) is mirrored at other cursors while in Insert mode, but edit is dropped on `<Esc>`: only typed keys survive the session-end replay.\r\n\r\n### Solution:\r\nFlag edit where `insert_handle_key()` already computes changedtick delta for those keys. On next clock edge, once preview holds edit, commit it with `mc_ins_cascade_restart()`: path `stop_arrow()` uses for a non-captured cursor-move, where previews stay as committed text and capture restarts.\r\nfix #42205 \r\n",
